OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FA mother has been awarded more than
OL,7,F#20,000 following an industrial
OL,8,Ftribunal ruling in an indirect sex
OL,9,Fdiscrimination case brought against a
OL,10,FCo Fermanagh hotel.
OL,12,FAnna Owens, who had worked as a
OL,13,Freceptionist at the Westville Hotel in
OL,14,FEnniskillen, argued that her agreed
OL,15,Fworking pattern, which allowed her to
OL,16,Fbalance childcare arrangements, had
OL,17,Fbeen changed.
OL,19,FMs Owens was supported by the Equality
OL,20,FCommission in the case.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FThe judgment was published on July 24
OL,7,Fand awarded her #20,488.79.
OL,9,FThe group that owns the hotel said it
OL,10,Fis considering the judgment, including
OL,11,Fwhether to appeal.
OL,13,FMs Owens told the tribunal that before
OL,14,Fbeginning work at the hotel, she had
OL,15,Fverbally agreed a three-day working
OL,16,Fweek.
OL,18,FShe said she had worked these agreed
OL,19,Fdays for 18 months with occasional
OL,20,Fchanges when notice was given to allow
OL,21,Fher to secure childcare.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FThe tribunal found this working
OL,7,Fpattern formed part of her contract of
OL,8,Femployment.
OL,10,FMs Owens said following the
OL,11,Fappointment of a new general manager
OL,12,Fat the hotel, she was told she would
OL,13,Fbe required to work on a flexible
OL,14,Fseven-day rota.
OL,16,FShe argued that the change to hours
OL,17,Fwas not feasible with her childcare
OL,18,Fneeds.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FShe told the tribunal that she was
OL,7,Funable to work some shifts and
OL,8,Fsuffered a reduction in hours and
OL,9,Fearnings.
OL,11,FMs Owens eventually resigned and
OL,12,Fbrought legal proceedings.
OL,14,FThe tribunal ruled that the treatment
OL,15,Fof Ms Owens amounted to indirect sex
OL,16,Fdiscrimination.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FThe judgment said: "The tribunal is
OL,7,Fpersuaded on balance the claimant was
OL,8,Fcontracted to work 24 hours each week
OL,9,Fon a Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday
OL,10,Fsave where variation by agreement
OL,11,Fwhere childcare arrangements could be
OL,12,Fput in place."
OL,14,FIt said when the new working
OL,15,Farrangement was imposed, the employer
OL,16,F"failed to properly investigate,
OL,17,Fconsider and fully address the
OL,18,Fconcerns and difficulties" raised by
OL,19,FMs Owens.
OL,26,@nD@TOUtD@NO]xD@AOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FIt added: "The tribunal find the
OL,7,Frespondent's unilateral variation of
OL,8,Fthe claimant's hours, shift pattern
OL,9,Fand flexible working arrangement alone
OL,10,Famounted to a breach of fundamental
OL,11,Fexpress oral and otherwise implied
OL,12,Fterms of her contract of employment."
OL,14,FThe tribunal panel said it accepted Ms
OL,15,FOwens' evidence that the episode had
OL,16,F"left a very damaging mark on her".
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@eO]xD@AOUxD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FThe judgment added: "The tribunal
OL,7,Fconsider the claimant's upset was
OL,8,Faggravated by high-handed approach of
OL,9,Frespondent introducing changes without
OL,10,Fregard for concerns raised by the
OL,11,Fclaimant."
OL,13,FMs Owens said: "I'm just a mum who
OL,14,Fwanted to work to provide for my
OL,15,Ffamily.
OL,17,F"I just needed my employer to work
OL,18,Fwith me to let me do my job.
OL,26,@nD@UOUsD@JO]uD@POUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,F"I felt betrayed and deflated that I
OL,7,Fwas less of a contributing team member
OL,8,Fbecause of my childcare
OL,9,Fresponsibilities.
OL,11,F"I hope I have made a difference for
OL,12,Fother parents who are trying to
OL,13,Fbalance work and caring
OL,14,Fresponsibilities."
OL,16,FGeraldine McGahey, Chief Commissioner
OL,17,Fat Equality Commission for Northern
OL,18,FIreland said: "Women continue to carry
OL,19,Fthe greatest share of caring
OL,20,Fresponsibilities in our society.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@RO]zD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,F"Proper consideration of flexible
OL,7,Fworking requests by employers can help
OL,8,Fthem to retain experienced staff while
OL,9,Fsupporting working parents.
OL,11,F"The decision to move to a flexible
OL,12,Fworking rota in this case was not made
OL,13,Fout of business need but presented as
OL,14,Fin the interests of fairness.
OL,16,F"Yet it proved to put Ms Owens at an
OL,17,Funfair disadvantage and caused her
OL,18,Funnecessary stress."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
