PN,41610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,FA statement from the Cassidy
OL,7,FHospitality Group, which owns the
OL,8,Fhotel, said: "Ms Owens was a valued
OL,9,Fand highly regarded member of our
OL,10,Freception team, and we were genuinely
OL,11,Fsorry that her employment with us
OL,12,Fended as it did.
OL,14,F"We note the tribunal's judgment and
OL,15,Fare considering it carefully with our
OL,16,Flegal advisers, including whether to
OL,17,Fappeal, so it would not be appropriate
OL,18,Fto comment on its detail.
OL,26,@pD@NOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/11
