CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786047509
OL,3,CNI mother awarded #20k tribunal payout
OL,4,Cover hotel's change to working patterns
OL,6,F"The hotel employs many working
OL,7,Fparents and carers, is committed to
OL,8,Fequality of opportunity for all of its
OL,9,Fstaff, and is strengthening its
OL,10,Fpolicies, training and procedures with
OL,11,Fexternal advice to support flexible
OL,12,Fworking wherever business needs allow."
OL,14,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
